       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TMMDELETE.
       AUTHOR.        R L ENSMINGER/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
       INSTALLATION.  GTR.
       DATE-COMPILED.

      *C  09/11/96  W L  MCINTYRE
      *C  MADE REVISIONS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPATABILITY
