       DATA DIVISION.

       FILE SECTION.

       FD  FILE1
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  REC1.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM0101.

       FD  FILE10
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  REC10.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1002.

       FD  FILE1101
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  REC1101.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1101.

       FD  FILE1102
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  REC1102.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1102.

